<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Dynextron Services India Limited operates as a highly efficient, lean technology enterprise headquartered in Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh. The firm specializes in engineering full-stack web applications, sophisticated fintech infrastructure, and custom software solutions designed primarily for B2B and institutional clients. By prioritizing a high-yield, low-overhead operational model under strict MSME compliance, the company consistently delivers high-margin digital products that bridge the gap between complex enterprise requirements and scalable digital execution.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
