379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Dynextron drives revenue through a diversified portfolio of proprietary technology platforms. Key assets include Paygem.co, a custom-engineered payment gateway and ledger management platform, and ExamBuddy OMR, which utilizes Pyodide and OpenCV for advanced optical evaluation in the ed-tech space. The company also develops and licenses its sForms Engine, an automated multi-step form builder optimized for institutional onboarding workflows. Beyond pure software development, the enterprise maintains an active Research and Development division focused on embedded electronics and IoT prototyping, utilizing ESP32-S3 microcontrollers and Arduino frameworks to pioneer local web servers, Wi-Fi captive portals, and automated security systems.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
