/T (Technical Architecture: Unlike traditional server-heavy grading systems, ExamBuddy OMR operates entirely client-side. By leveraging Pyodide to run Python environments directly within the web browser and utilizing OpenCV for advanced computer vision algorithms, the platform performs complex image processing on the user's local device. This architecture guarantees zero server compute latency, drastically reduces cloud overhead costs, and ensures strict data privacy compliance since sensitive student assessment images never leave the local device.)
/E (Technical Architecture: Unlike traditional server-heavy grading systems, ExamBuddy OMR operates entirely client-side. By leveraging Pyodide to run Python environments directly within the web browser and utilizing OpenCV for advanced computer vision algorithms, the platform performs complex image processing on the user's local device. This architecture guarantees zero server compute latency, drastically reduces cloud overhead costs, and ensures strict data privacy compliance since sensitive student assessment images never leave the local device.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
